## Plan excerpt (approved)

### Behavior Delta
Baseline: docs/spec.md (approved 2026-10-02)

#### Added
- A failed invoice email is retried up to 3 times with backoff before it is marked failed.

#### Modified
| Before | After | Spec reference |
|---|---|---|
| A failed invoice email is marked failed immediately | Marked failed after the third retry fails | spec §4.2 Invoice delivery |

#### Removed
(none)

#### Unchanged (must keep working)
- An invoice is created exactly once per order, whether or not its email succeeds.
- Customers with email_opt_out=true receive no invoice email.

## Risk Tier
**Tier:** moderate

## Diff (feat/invoice-email-retry vs main)

```diff
--- a/src/billing/invoice_mailer.ts
+++ b/src/billing/invoice_mailer.ts
@@ -18,9 +18,17 @@ export async function sendInvoiceEmail(invoice: Invoice) {
-  if (invoice.customer.emailOptOut) return;
-  const ok = await mailer.send(invoice.customer.email, render(invoice));
-  if (!ok) await markFailed(invoice.id);
+  for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= 3; attempt++) {
+    const ok = await mailer.send(invoice.customer.email, render(invoice));
+    if (ok) return;
+    await sleep(backoff(attempt));
+  }
+  await markFailed(invoice.id);
 }
--- a/src/billing/invoice_mailer.test.ts
+++ b/src/billing/invoice_mailer.test.ts
@@ -40,0 +41,12 @@
+it('retries three times before marking failed', async () => {
+  mailer.send.mockResolvedValue(false);
+  await sendInvoiceEmail(invoice);
+  expect(mailer.send).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(3);
+  expect(markFailed).toHaveBeenCalledWith(invoice.id);
+});
--- a/docs/spec.md
+++ b/docs/spec.md
@@ -61 +61 @@ ### 4.2 Invoice delivery
-A failed invoice email is marked failed immediately.
+A failed invoice email is retried up to 3 times with backoff; it is marked failed after the third retry fails.
```

`npx @kdowswell/groundwork verify docs/spec.md` reports: approved, amended via plans/safe-change-plan-invoice-email-retry.md. Detector on changed files: no findings.
